<title>USA: NY delays Central Hudson settlement to Thurs.</title>
<headline>NY delays Central Hudson settlement to Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Public Service Commission said Tuesday it postponed filing a settlement agreement on the restructuring plan of Central Hudson Gas &amp; Electric Corp until Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;All parties are advised that the March 18, 1997 date for filing a settlement agreement in the Central Hudson Gas &amp; Electric Corp cas is hereby extended to March 20, 1997,&quot; the commission said in a statement.</p>
<p>The commission did not provide a reason for the delay in the filing.</p>
<p>((--New York Power Desk +1 212 859 1622))</p>
</text>
